{"id":"663743","name":"鸡蛋炒蔬菜","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/663743/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"红尖椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"荷兰豆","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土鸡蛋，焯水的荷兰豆、红尖椒。","img":"images/663743/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加入适量的食用油加热，倒入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/663743/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋凝固即可盛出。","img":"images/663743/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"先炒红尖椒。","img":"images/663743/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加入已焯水的荷兰豆。","img":"images/663743/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量的料酒、盐、翻炒。","img":"images/663743/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入鸡蛋翻炒。","img":"images/663743/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用筷子将鸡蛋夹成适当的块，加入少许鸡精翻炒出锅。","img":"images/663743/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盛入盘中，红、绿、黄色很美观，又营养。","img":"images/663743/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}